    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive a Hostile World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange planet that changes with each death. Traverse unique biomes, each offering their own challenges that you'll have to adapt to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abilities that change the way you interact with the world. You might learn to burrow through earth or bounce off of it like a ball. Each one has multiple uses to find, each of which will help you solve puzzles and access new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Strange Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome is home to a unique ecosystem, full of lifeforms that might help or hurt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is dense and full of things to find. With each life and death, you'll discover new knowledge about the world to help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/85a18561238fe57f1ab1dc50d8d81418.poster.avif?t=1746818717\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/85a18561238fe57f1ab1dc50d8d81418.webm?t=1746818717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive a Hostile World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange planet that changes with each death. Traverse unique biomes, each offering their own challenges that you'll have to adapt to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abilities that change the way you interact with the world. You might learn to burrow through earth or bounce off of it like a ball. Each one has multiple uses to find, each of which will help you solve puzzles and access new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Strange Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome is home to a unique ecosystem, full of lifeforms that might help or hurt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is dense and full of things to find. With each life and death, you'll discover new knowledge about the world to help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/85a18561238fe57f1ab1dc50d8d81418.poster.avif?t=1746818717\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/85a18561238fe57f1ab1dc50d8d81418.webm?t=1746818717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
